{"v3_38a5666f59f494ff7688960b":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京都出身19歳\n大野愛実だに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mob8hcq3m.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのツーショット✌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ陽世さんのブログがクローズされちゃうらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤ！イヤッ！ ヤダーーーーーーッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ陽世さんと一緒にいたいんだよォーーーーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか小さくてかわいい先輩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mob9lhWs6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…ちいかわ…ってコト！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※こんなブログ書いてますが、劇場版ちいかわはまだ観ておりません※"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眩しいッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobfch4Ry.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽が眩しいわけじゃなく〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗な〜陽世さんのせいだよ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobaOrxV8.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏なんて〜暑いだけで〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"退屈だと思ってた〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobUrUMnZ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":